  "details": "I hope people actually read these. See, i don't get motion sickness and other non-sensitive people like me would Love to have a 3rd person toggle in Virtual Reality. similar to PC / Desktop  there would be a toggle for it in Graphics. And if you're afraid of people with severe motion sickness toggling it on accident you can add an additional Yes Or No warning  to it. I would die for this feature and I'm sure many others would too because it would be really cool to have. And i hate to seem desperate but Please, *PLEASE*  add this.  Anyway, if you can't add it, thanks for at least taking the time to read this. <3\n\ni also would like to note that if it makes any difference or helps in any way i will buy VRC+ if this does get added. And another thing, if the excuse on not to do this is that not enough people wants it then explain most avatars that have this 3rd pov feature as a workaround, I'm not trying to be rude but I'd still like to use most avatars (that don't never 3rd person) with a third person perspective. Yet again i hate to seem desperate but i beg you to add this.",
